{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_13204040","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13204040","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"narration:0:1320404001:0":{"text":"你们换下衣物，在温泉里舒服地泡了好一阵子","source_cn":"你们换下衣物，在温泉里舒服地泡了好一阵子","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB15260FA3FD1383","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320404002:0":{"text":"哇……泡温泉好舒服呀，感觉身体里的疲惫都被热气融化了。","source_cn":"哇……泡温泉好舒服呀，感觉身体里的疲惫都被热气融化了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x543910E6730984AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320404003:0":{"text":"不过，这水对满满来说有点深，呛到我好几次！","source_cn":"不过，这水对满满来说有点深，呛到我好几次！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E45AA2321689ACF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320404004:0":{"text":"……笨满满，水里有很多石头，你可以坐在上面。","source_cn":"……笨满满，水里有很多石头，你可以坐在上面。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A8E25A257D3F99C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320404005:0":{"text":"这可不能怪我！温泉里人那么多，舒适的位置早就被占住了。","source_cn":"这可不能怪我！温泉里人那么多，舒适的位置早就被占住了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88F916065817A5FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_t